    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quietly tucked away at the end of a small, quiet, cul de sac, this bright mature semi-detached 1950’s family home lies off the Stillorgan Road, beside the former Montrose Hotel. Whilst requiring modernisation and updating it provides an opportunity to a buyer to set their own stamp on a property in a location where houses seldom change hands.\r\n\r\nAshfield Park is a sought after residential address adjacent to the N11, approx.4km from St Stephens Green, close to the Stillorgan QBC, RTE, and just a few minutes stroll to the university campus at Belfield. The redeveloped Montrose Hotel now offers an array of amenities including a bank, café, and convenience store within a stones throw of Ashfield Park.\r\n\r\nBlackrock, Merrion, Ballsbridge and Donnybrook are close by, providing a wide range of amenities including specialist shops, shopping centres, restaurants, cafes and pubs. St Vincent’s Hospital and some of Dublin’s finest schools are in the vicinity including St Andrews College, Blackrock College, Willow Park, Teresians and Booterstown National Schools."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall                       \r\n4.0 x 1.81\r\n\r\nLiving room           \r\n4.54 x 3.19           \r\nWith tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nStudy 1                 \r\n3.28 x 2.40           \r\nWith door to garden.\r\n\r\nStudy 2                 \r\n3.28 x 2.06\r\n\r\nTV room                \r\n4.66 x 2.19           \r\nConverted garage.\r\n\r\nKitchen                 \r\n3.27 x 2.38            \r\nWith built in kitchen units. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nB’fast Area             \r\n4.09 x 2.68           \r\nWith tiled floor. Door to garden.\r\n\r\nShower room                                       \r\nDownstairs shower w/c & washbasin.\r\n\r\nBed 1                    \r\n4.65 x 3.57           \r\nDouble bedroom.\r\n\r\nBed 2                    \r\n3.58 x 3.34           \r\nDouble bedroom.\r\n\r\nBed 3                    \r\n3.40 x 2.07           \r\nSingle bedroom.\r\n\r\nBed 4                    \r\n3.38 x 2.05           \r\nSingle bedroom.\r\n\r\nShower room 1                                    \r\nWith shower w/c & washbasin.\r\n\r\nShower room 2                                   \r\nWith shower w/c & washbasin.\r\n\r\n\r\nGross Internal Area:\r\nc. 130.22 sq.m. (c.1,402 sq.ft.)\r\n\r\n\r\nBER:\r\nE. No.111346235."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-  4 Bedrooms\r\n-  Converted Garage\r\n-  Downstairs shower room\r\n-  PVC double glazed windows\r\n-  Gas fired radiator central heating\r\n-  Back garden\r\n-  Private off street parking\r\n-  Located at the end of small cul de sac\r\n-  Short walk to UCD Belfield\r\n-  Close to Merrion Shopping Centre, St Vincents Hospital & RTE\r\n-  Adjacent several bus routes on QBC (N11) and DART at Booterstown\r\n-  Numerous fine schools nearby"
